  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GAL 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu ana kwetu, neyi anawani muntu navulumuni, enu mwendaŋa muSpiritu, mufuntishenu muntu wudi ochu naspiritu yakudizoza; babalaku hadaha nineyi akakweseka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sendaŋanenu yisenda yenu; neyi mukwila mwenimu, mukwila lushimbi lwaKristu chikupu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu wadimonaŋa yomweni nindi nimuntu walema, iku wamukunkulwayi, nadidimbi tuhu kwindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa antu ejima ashinshiki nyidimu yawu, muntu himuntu. Muntu wukwila mwenomu, diyi wukumona hakudisambila namudimu windi yomwenindi, bayi kudisamba namudimu wawacheŋuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa antu ejima akadisendela yiteli yawu, iwu nachindi, iwu nachindi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.6.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu aleja ŋawu mazu aNzambi, akwashi owu wamulejaŋa nayuma yayiwahi yejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi mudi dimbaku, Nzambi hiyamusehaŋaku; yonsu yakudimayi muntu, diyi yakadyayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu wukukuwila chisemwa chindi chaheseki, wakadya kutoka kuchisemwa chaheseki; hakwila yena wukukuwila Spiritu, wakadya wumi wahaya nyaka kudi Spiritu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi tuzeyaloŋa nakwila mwamuwahuku, muloŋa twakadya hachila aka chakudya, neyi tunabuli kuzeya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi dinu, neyi tukumona hakwilila, twilenuŋa antu ejima chachiwahi; tubadiki kwilila akwetala dakwitiya kwakukuhwelela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Talenu ŋi nsona jamaneni jinayisonekeli nachikasa chamami aweni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu ejima ayikakejaŋa nawu ayalamishi, wowu akeŋa kuyilemesha kudi antu munyijimba, kulonda abuli kuyikabishila nsaŋu yakulusu yaKristu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.6.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutoŋa hela awenawu alama dehi hiyelaŋa kwawu nyidimu yanshimbuku; anakeŋi nawu enu chiŋa mwalami hohu, kulonda akadisambi nansaŋu yanyijimba yenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwila ami kudisamba chinjila, chiŋa nakulusu yaMwanta wetu Yesu Kristu hohu. Mpata yamunu mwishina ampopelayi dehi kukulusu, ninami ampopa dehi kunsaŋu yampata yamunu mwishina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa kwalama, hela kubula kwalama, hikukweti chumaku, chiŋa yowu kuleŋa kwakwiha hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuwunda niluwi Iwikali nawantu ejima akwila mwenimu namutunayileji, niaIsarela ambala aNzambi nawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.6.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kufuma kulelu, bayi ankabisha nawa kudi muntuku, muloŋa ami nasenda yibata yaYesu mumujimba wami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.6.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
